{
 "id": "arc-left-back",
 "title": "Left back for the cup",
 "owner": "manager",
 "summary": "Injuries leave the gaffer with no left back, and he asks you to play there. Weeks later the left back is fit and the gaffer has a choice, or the kid who got skinned is struggling. Next season he needs a favour again, and after that everybody knows what you are.",
 "size": "small",
